<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US">
  <voice name="s1">So wait. I asked Claude why my build was failing, and instead of a wall of text, it made... us?</voice>
  <voice name="s2">[chuckle] Yep. One command, explain as podcast, and you get two hosts walking through it.</voice>
  <break time="300ms"/>
  <voice name="s1">And this all runs on my own laptop? No cloud, no API key?</voice>
  <voice name="s2">All local. Chatterbox Turbo on your Mac or GPU. About a minute of rendering per minute of audio.</voice>
  <voice name="s1">Okay, but can it do the thing where podcast hosts laugh at their own jokes?</voice>
  <voice name="s2">[laugh] Unfortunately, yes.</voice>
  <break time="400ms"/>
  <voice name="s1">Install it, ask Claude to explain anything as a podcast, and that's it.</voice>
</speak>
